rs, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years. In 2025, October to November came in at 36% of normal on the middle, and November to December at 32%. Every grid in the county had its driest year in 1986, with grid 19400 at 68% of normal that year.</p>"}
